<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<title>idea-discovery-session</title>
<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}
body{margin:0 auto;max-width:52rem;padding:2rem 1.25rem;
font:16px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;
color:#1b1b1b;background:#fff}
h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6{line-height:1.25;margin:2rem 0 .6rem}
h1{font-size:1.9rem} h2{font-size:1.45rem} h3{font-size:1.15rem}
p,ul,ol,blockquote,table,pre{margin:0 0 1rem}
code{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:.9em;
background:#f2f2f2;padding:.1em .3em;border-radius:3px}
pre{background:#f6f6f6;padding:.9rem 1rem;border-radius:5px;overflow-x:auto}
pre code{background:none;padding:0}
blockquote{border-left:3px solid #d0d0d0;margin-left:0;padding-left:1rem;
color:#4a4a4a}
table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;display:block;overflow-x:auto}
th,td{border:1px solid #ddd;padding:.4rem .6rem;text-align:left}
th{background:#f6f6f6}
hr{border:0;border-top:1px solid #ddd;margin:2rem 0}
a{color:#0b57d0}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){
body{color:#e6e6e6;background:#151515}
code{background:#242424} pre{background:#1d1d1d}
th{background:#1d1d1d} th,td{border-color:#333}
blockquote{border-left-color:#3a3a3a;color:#b0b0b0} a{color:#8ab4f8}}</style></head>
<body>
<h2>Idea Discovery Session — {{ date }}</h2>
<h3>Session Metadata</h3>
<ul><li><strong>Time spent:</strong> [X] hours</li><li><strong>Frameworks used:</strong> [list framework numbers 1-7]</li><li><strong>Total ideas generated:</strong> {{ total_ideas_generated }}</li></ul>
<h3>Ideas Generated</h3>
<h4>Idea 1: [Name]</h4>
<ul><li><strong>Source framework:</strong> {{ framework_name }}</li><li><strong>Problem solved:</strong> {{ description }}</li><li><strong>Target audience:</strong> {{ who }}</li><li><strong>Rough solution:</strong> {{ how }}</li><li><strong>Market Size (1-5):</strong> {{ score }}</li><li><strong>Personal Fit (1-5):</strong> [score — fill BEFORE viewing market data]</li><li><strong>Competition (1-5):</strong> {{ score }}</li><li><strong>Monetization (1-5):</strong> {{ score }}</li><li><strong>Speed to MVP (1-5):</strong> {{ score }}</li><li><strong>Weighted total:</strong> [computed: Market×0.20 + Fit×0.25 + Competition×0.15 + Monetization×0.20 + MVP×0.20]</li><li><strong>Notes:</strong> {{ notes }}</li></ul>
<h4>Idea 2: [Name]</h4>
<p>[repeat structure]</p>
<h3>Top 3 to Validate (sorted by weighted total)</h3>
<ol><li>[Idea] — Score: [X]</li><li>[Idea] — Score: [X]</li><li>[Idea] — Score: [X]</li></ol>
<h3>Rejected (keep for future reference)</h3>
<ul><li>[Idea]: [one-line reason for rejection]</li></ul>
<h3>Next Steps</h3>
<ul><li>[ ] Validate idea 1 via [pain-point-research / user-interviews / landing page test]</li><li>[ ] Research competitors for idea 2</li><li>[ ] Find potential users for idea 3</li></ul>
</body></html>
